{"contract":"bw-jmdict-shard/3","entries":[{"common":true,"etymology":[],"examples":[{"en":"When he was about to pass, the Sphinx jumped in front of him.","ja":"彼が通り過ぎようとしたとき、スフィンクスは彼の前に飛び出した。","ref":"284025_119637","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"Suddenly, the Sphinx raised its head.","ja":"突然、スフィンクスがその頭を上げた。","ref":"280639_123359","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"The Sphinx began to walk around him.","ja":"スフィンクスは彼のまわりを歩き始めた。","ref":"51819_214527","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"The Sphinx had eaten hundreds of people on their way to the city of Thebes, because they could not answer the riddle the cunning Sphinx had asked them.","ja":"スフィンクスはテーベ市へ行く途中の何百人もの人を食べてしまっていた。というのはその人達が、こうかつなスフィンクスが出すなぞなぞに答えられなかったからであった。","ref":"51820_214528","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"This terrible monster was the Sphinx.","ja":"この恐ろしい怪物はスフィンクスであった。","ref":"59682_222355","source":"tanaka"}],"forms":["獅子女"],"glosses":["sphinx"],"id":"1072540","lemma":"獅子女","pos":["n"],"readings":["スフィンクス"],"sourceUrls":["https://zh.wiktionary.org/wiki/スフィンクス#Japanese","https://kaikki.org/zhwiktionary/All%20languages%20combined/meaning/ス/スフ/スフィンクス.html"],"synonyms":[],"zhGlosses":["(希腊神话)斯芬克斯。","(埃及的)人面狮身像。"],"zhSenses":[{"examples":[],"glosses":["(希腊神话)斯芬克斯。"],"pos":""},{"examples":[],"glosses":["(埃及的)人面狮身像。"],"pos":""}]},{"accent":0,"common":true,"etymology":[],"examples":[{"ja":"単に知識を獲得するための方法を説明するものに過ぎない。","ref":"1931年，戸坂潤，辞典：","source":"wty","zh":"這只不過是對如何獲得知識之方法的說明。"},{"en":"He is full of ambition for power.","ja":"彼は権力獲得に野心満々だ。","ref":"295965_107724","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"He has managed to secure several accounts.","ja":"彼は苦労して顧客を獲得した。","ref":"295577_108109","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"He gained the prize by dint of hard work.","ja":"彼は勤勉によって賞を獲得した。","ref":"295412_108274","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"His music has attained great popularity overseas.","ja":"彼の音楽は海外で大変な人気を獲得した。","ref":"285645_118019","source":"tanaka"}],"forms":["獲得"],"glosses":["acquisition","possession"],"id":"1205750","lemma":"獲得","pos":["n","vs","vt",